To gather from node (a whole number) with code (a whole number).
If node is less than 0, return.
The column is code divided by 10000 minus 1000.
The depth is code modulo 10000.
Place item node of labels into order.
The key is (column plus 1000) times 100000000 plus depth times 10000 plus item node of labels.
Place key into keys.
Gather from item node of lefts with (code minus 10000).
Gather from item node of rights with (code plus 10000).

Gather from 0 with 10000000.
For every spot from 1 to the last position of keys.
The hold is item spot of keys.
The keep is item spot of order.
The prior is spot minus 1.
Repeat while prior is at least 0 and item prior of keys is more than hold.
Set item (prior plus 1) of keys to item prior of keys.
Set item (prior plus 1) of order to item prior of order.
Subtract 1 from prior.
Set item (prior plus 1) of keys to hold.
Set item (prior plus 1) of order to keep.

For every spot from 0 to the last position of keys.
The packed is item spot of keys.
The column is packed divided by 100000000 minus 1000.
If seen is more than 0 and column is not shown, show "---".
Show item spot of order.
Set shown to column.
Add 1 to seen.
